# Panes - obsidian (actions/obsidian/obsidian_panes.kbd)
**panes + ent**      -- Pane Maximize
**panes + h**        -- Pane Left
**panes + l**        -- Pane Right
**panes + up**       -- Pane Above
**panes + j**        -- Pane Below
**panes + -**        -- Pane H Split
**panes + \**        -- Pane V Split
**panes + w**        -- Pane Close
**panes + toggle**   -- Pane Toggle
**panes + s**        -- Sidebar
**panes + lsft + s** -- Sidebar Right
**panes + g**        -- Select Files
**panes + m**        -- Main
